## 三、建议的代码审查顺序

如果你只做一次完整 review，建议按这个顺序：

1. `apps/api_gateway/main.py`
2. `aats/bootstrap/settings.py`
3. `aats/bootstrap/config.py`
4. `aats/services/governance_engine/runtime_layers.py`
5. `aats/services/governance_engine/policy.py`
6. `aats/services/governance_engine/risk.py`
7. `aats/services/execution_engine/order_manager.py`
8. `aats/services/execution_engine/okx_adapter.py`
9. `aats/services/portfolio_service/positions.py`
10. `aats/services/reconciliation_service/comparator.py`
11. `aats/services/reconciliation_service/repair.py`
12. `aats/services/execution_engine/recovery.py`
13. `aats/api/auth.py`
14. `aats/api/routes.py`
15. `aats/api/static/app.js`

这样做的好处是：
- 先确定系统到底怎么被构建
- 再看能不能交易
- 再看为什么被阻断
- 最后看 UI 有没有把事实说清楚

